## [Issue Title: Docker Hub DNS Resolution Timeout]

**Date:** 2026-04-05
**Environment:** UAT-TEST-ENV / Ubuntu / Docker Compose

###  Symptom
> `Error: dial tcp: lookup auth.docker.io on 127.0.0.53:53: i/o timeout`

###  Cause
Explain *why* it happened (e.g., Local systemd-resolved failing to forward requests to external DNS).

###  Resolution
Provide the exact commands to fix it.
1. Restart the resolver: `sudo systemctl restart systemd-resolved`
2. If persistent, update `/etc/docker/daemon.json` with Google DNS (`8.8.8.8`).

###  Prevention
How to avoid this in the future (e.g., "Add DNS checks to the deployment script").
